{"id":8352,"name":"Prince George’s County","slug":"prince-georges-county","state":"Maryland","code":"MD","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-lien/tax-lien-states/maryland-tax-liens-earn-solid-as-a-beginner/prince-georges-county/","lastUpdated":"2026-07-13T12:29:54","facts":{"taxSaleType":"Tax Lien Certificates","redemptionPeriod":"Anytime until foreclosure","interestRate":"8%","bidProcedure":"Sealed bid","extra":[{"label":"Typical Date of Sale","value":"May"},{"label":"Sale Contact","value":"Department of Finance"},{"label":"Auction Site","value":"Prince George’s County Auction Site"},{"label":"County Website","value":"Prince George’s County"}]},"bodyHtml":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"85dOmyXzDsE9CAWv2nlP0FYQLk4cRjqhu7g3U\"><iframe title=\"Invest Online for an 8% Return - Prince George&#039;s County - Maryland Tax Lien Investing\" width=\"1170\" height=\"658\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/9su72vZaqQc?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-invest-online-for-an-8-return-prince-george-s-county-maryland-tax-lien-investing\">Invest Online for an 8% Return &#8211; Prince George&#8217;s County &#8211; Maryland Tax Lien Investing</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Discover the opportunity to earn an 8% return through Prince George&#8217;s County, Maryland&#8217;s tax lien certificate auction. This auction is an internet-based, sealed bid process that is open to everyone, making it a straightforward way to get into real estate investment without needing to live in Maryland.</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Overview-of-the-Auction-Process\">Overview of the Auction Process</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>The tax lien auction in Prince George&#8217;s County is designed for ease of participation:</p>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Registration</strong>: Register online by visiting the <a href=\"https://taxsale.princegeorgescountymd.gov/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Prince George&#8217;s County Tax Sale website</mark></a>. You&#8217;ll need to pay a $150 registration fee and a $1,000 deposit, which goes toward your purchases or is refunded if no certificates are awarded.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Bid Submission</strong>: Bids can be submitted over a period of time, with certificates awarded to the highest bidders.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Payment</strong>: Successful bidders must pay the total amount due via wire transfer or cashier’s check by 3:00 p.m. the day after the auction. Bidders must complete IRS Form W-9 and an Authorization for Electronic Funds Disbursement.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Important-Auction-Details\">Important Auction Details</h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Bid Procedure</strong>: Sealed bid with high bid premium, where the highest bid wins.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>High Bid Premium</strong>: A premium is 20% of the amount by which your bid exceeds 40% of the property&#8217;s assessed value. The county refunds this premium upon property redemption or when it delivers a tax sale deed.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Assignment-Tax-Sale-Certificates\">Assignment Tax Sale Certificates</h4>\n\n\n\n<p>For properties that remain unsold after the auction, Assignment Tax Sale certificates are available for purchase starting June 10, 2024. These can be acquired directly by emailing <a href=\"mailto:TAXSALE@CO.PG.MD.US\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">TAXSALE@CO.PG.MD.US</mark></a> with the parcel number, owner’s name, and tax amount.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Prince-Georges-County-Judicial.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Prince-Georges-County-Judicial-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Prince-Georges-County-Judicial-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Prince-Georges-County-Judicial-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Prince-Georges-County-Judicial-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Prince-Georges-County-Judicial-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Prince-Georges-County-Judicial.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Prince-Georges-County-Judicial.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Prince-Georges-County-Judicial-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Prince-Georges-County-Judicial-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Prince-Georges-County-Judicial-768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Prince-Georges-County-Judicial-20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Prince-Georges-County-Judicial-32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-16970 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Prince George&#039;s County Judicial\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Book a Call with Dustin Hahn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Key-Details-and-Links\">Key Details and Links</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Steps-to-Get-Started\">Steps to Get Started</h3>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Research Local Laws</strong>: Understanding the legal framework is crucial. Visit the <a href=\"https://www.princegeorgescountymd.gov/departments-offices/finance\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Prince George&#8217;s County Department of Finance</mark></a> for more details.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Register Online</strong>: Complete your registration and necessary forms by the deadline.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Prepare Your Bids</strong>: Strategize to avoid overbidding, but aim high enough to secure the property.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Pro-Tips\">Pro Tips</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Do Your Due Diligence</strong>: Inspect properties and understand the terms and conditions before bidding.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Monitor Your Account</strong>: Ensure funds are available for successful bids.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Use Assignment Certificates</strong>: If you miss the main auction, look into Assignment Tax Sale certificates for additional opportunities.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"FAQs\">FAQs</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: Can I participate if I don&#8217;t live in Maryland?</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p> A: Yes, the auction is open to all, regardless of residency.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: What happens if I don&#8217;t pay for my winning bid?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: The system will not award you any certificates and may bar you from future sales.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>How do I redeem a property?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>A: The current owner can redeem the property anytime until foreclosure by paying the taxes owed.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Useful-Links\">Useful Links</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://taxsale.princegeorgescountymd.gov/BiddingRules.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Bidding Rules</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.princegeorgescountymd.gov/departments-offices/finance\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Prince George&#8217;s County Department of Finance</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.princegeorgescountymd.gov/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Prince George&#8217;s County Website</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-lien/tax-lien-states/maryland-tax-liens-